# IPOFins.com — core rules

## Stack

- Astro 4.x, TypeScript strict, PostgreSQL 16 (Neon), Node.js 22, Tailwind CSS v4
- Schema: `db/migrations/`, `db/verify-schema.mjs`
- Read `DESIGN.md` and `CONTEXT.md` before UI / pipeline work

## Git

- **Never merge to `main` from agents** — feature branch only

## Absolute rules

- Money: `NUMERIC`; timestamps: `TIMESTAMPTZ`; rupee ₹
- Smart money: `mv_smart_money_latest` (not raw `fund_holdings` aggregates)
- Use `stock_id`, not `security_id`
